@startuml
title UC-FL-001 登记部门与跨部门任务 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "任务发起成员" as A
boundary "接口:普通成员接口" as B
control "控制:登记部门与跨部门任务控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "F:流转任务" as F
participant "G:任务阶段" as G
participant "D:部门" as D
A -> B: 登记部门与跨部门任务(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 登记部门与跨部门任务(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> F: 建立任务(需求来源、部门与有序阶段、成果要求)
activate F
loop 每个参与阶段
  F -> D: 检查承办资格(阶段工作要求)
  D --> F: 部门有效性与责任范围
end
F -> G: 检查可开始(前序条件)
G --> F: 首阶段可派发，后续阶段等待
F --> C: 有序阶段任务或信息不合法原因
deactivate F

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
